text.en:
The Minister may, with the approval of His Majesty the Sultan and Yang Di-Pertuan, make rules generally for carrying out the provision of this Act, and, without prejudice to the generality of the foregoing, to provide for —

(a) the appointment, duties, privileges and powers of persons to enforce the provisions of this Act or any petroleum mining Agreement made thereunder;

(b) the prescribing of fees to be paid in respect of anything to be done in accordance with the provisions of this Act or any petroleum mining Agreement made hereunder.
